to-be-incorporated-into-paper-29 : List Word
to-be-incorporated-into-paper-29 = unlines (cons "- **Names in hyperactivity follow Avik's account of meaning.** A word means its usage history, with no consensus" (cons "  meaning and no authority minting one. A definition's identity is its content and a name is the view" (cons "  one person holds of it, so everyone has their own names over shared definitions, and shared meaning" (cons "  is shared history. A global namespace is the computing equivalent of believing in a dictionary" (cons "  meaning." nil)))))
